Messengers enter Rajagriha the same night --- Bharata dreams inauspicious dream and wakes distressed --- Friends fail to cheer him with music and plays --- Bharata sees father soiled falling into dung lake --- Father drinks oil laughs eats sesame head down --- Ocean dries moon falls fire dies earth splits --- King in black laughed at rides donkey south --- Bharata foretells death for Rama Lakshmana or king
